  "ruleText": "Lab 1503.04 Temporary Help Employee Prohibited. No employee leasing company shall provide temporary help employees through the same entity as the applicants leased employees, or commingle the funds of the 2 entities.\n\nSource. #6626, eff 11-4-97, EXPIRED: 11-4-05\n\nNew. #10221, eff 11-3-12, ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22",
